Equivalent restatements (all VERIFIED-EXACT here):
   W          = varpi^2 - 2 varpi S(4)
   S(4)       = (varpi^2 - W)/(2 varpi)
   addendum-5 Lambda = 2G + D = 2.0125581645516143722233809261004905017856041251944
   |W - varpi^2(1 - 4 Lambda/pi^2)| = 2.0701e-171
